.DS_Store

# Secrets — only .env.example is ever committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. sim-core is consumed as a
# `github:okjake/sim-core#v0.1.0` dependency, and pnpm does not build git
# dependencies that have no `prepare` script — so the build output (library
# JS + d.ts, and the admin SPA in dist/public) is committed on purpose.
# Run `pnpm build` and commit dist/ with any source change.
